<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
@page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
{{ css|safe }}
.back {
  width: 210mm; height: 296.5mm; overflow: hidden; position: relative;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(201, 160, 99, .16), transparent 44%),
    linear-gradient(170deg, #FAF6EF, #F3EBDC);
  color: var(--ink); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.back-inner { text-align: center; max-width: 166mm; }
.back h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 32pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 5pt; color: var(--red-deep); }
.back .sub { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--gold2); font-size: 11.5pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; margin-top: 5mm; }
.back .gold { width: 16mm; height: 2.2pt; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), var(--gold)); margin: 8mm auto 0; border-radius: 1pt; }
.roles { display: flex; gap: 6mm; margin-top: 10mm; }
.roles .r {
  flex: 1; background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 2.2pt solid var(--red);
  border-radius: 8pt; padding: 7pt 4pt 6pt;
}
.roles .duty { font-size: 8.2pt; color: var(--muted); }
.roles .name {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); font-size: 9.8pt;
  margin-top: 1.5pt; text-wrap: balance;   /* 长职名两行均衡断行，防末字孤行 */
}
.back .line1 { color: var(--ink); font-size: 9.4pt; margin-top: 9mm; letter-spacing: .5pt; }
.back .line2 { color: var(--muted); font-size: 8.8pt; margin-top: 2.5mm; }
.back .fine { color: var(--muted); font-size: 8.2pt; margin-top: 8mm; line-height: 1.95; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="back">
  <div class="back-inner">
    <h1>{{ back.title }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ back.sub }}</div>
    <div class="gold"></div>
    <div class="roles">
      {% for duty, name in back.roles %}
      <div class="r"><div class="duty">{{ duty }}</div><div class="name">{{ name }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="line1">{{ back.line1 }}</div>
    <div class="line2">{{ back.line2 }}</div>
    <div class="fine">
      本路书由 TripMate 多 Agent 协同旅游规划系统自动汇编，仅供出行参考<br>
      车票 / 酒店 / 门票请在官方渠道完成预订与支付（系统不接触支付）<br>
      天气、路线与价格为生成时点数据，出行前请再次核实
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
